From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Eikum <aeikum@codeweavers.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Jun 2017 12:35:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] HACK: steam: ntdll: Append C:/Program Files (x86)/Steam to
 PATH.

Wheelio: games that load steamclient.dll or the overlay by bare name find
the copies the launcher puts in the prefix's Steam folder, as on Proton.

Origin: ValveSoftware/wine adba6db13ee035341983ee2c8e72b2440a2900c1.
---
 dlls/ntdll/loader.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index c8fc177..21ad072 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -86,7 +86,7 @@ const WCHAR windows_dir[] = L"C:\\windows";
 static const WCHAR system_dir[] = L"C:\\windows\\system32\\";
 
 /* system search path */
-static const WCHAR system_path[] = L"C:\\windows\\system32;C:\\windows\\system;C:\\windows";
+static const WCHAR system_path[] = L"C:\\windows\\system32;C:\\windows\\system;C:\\windows;C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam";
 
 static BOOL is_prefix_bootstrap;  /* are we bootstrapping the prefix? */
 static BOOL wow64_using_32bit_prefix;  /* are we using a 32-bit-only prefix in wow64 mode? */
